**.subckt top_fc_output_swing_tb
x1 Balance_Level Vinp voutp VDDA voutn Vinn Iref VSSA top_fc
C1 voutn VSSA 20p
C2 voutp VSSA 20p
V1 VDDA VSSA VDDA
V3 VSSA 0 0
V4 Balance_Level VSSA Balance_Level
I0 Iref VSSA 1u
Bvinp Vinp VSSA V = {VCM + (V(Vcmd)-(V(voutp)-V(voutn)))/2}
Bvinn Vinn VSSA V = {VCM - (V(Vcmd)-(V(voutp)-V(voutn)))/2}
Vdiff Vdiff VSSA 0
Vcmd Vcmd VSSA 0
